:null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2004-reserva-4-2","n":2,"num":2,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Considera la función \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) definida por \\(f(x)=x|x|\\).","apartados":["(0,75 p.) Dibuja la región acotada del plano que está limitada por la gráfica de \\(f\\) y la bisectriz del primer y tercer cuadrante.","(1,75 p.) Calcula el área de la región descrita en el apartado anterior."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[f(x)=\\begin{cases}-x^2&\\text{si }x\\lt0\\\\x^2&\\text{si }x\\geq0\\end{cases}\\qquad\\text{y la bisectriz }y=x\\]<p>Cortes: para \\(x\\geq0\\), \\(x^2=x\\Rightarrow x=0,1\\); para \\(x\\lt0\\), \\(-x^2=x\\Rightarrow x=-1\\). Puntos \\((-1,-1)\\), \\((0,0)\\) y \\((1,1)\\).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 260' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='73.5,198.8 75.4,195.4 77.4,192.0 79.3,188.8 81.2,185.7 83.1,182.6 85.0,179.7 86.9,176.8 88.8,174.0 90.7,171.3 92.6,168.7 94.6,166.1 96.5,163.7 98.4,161.3 100.3,159.0 102.2,156.9 104.1,154.8 106.0,152.7 107.9,150.8 109.9,148.9 111.8,147.2 113.7,145.5 115.6,143.9 117.5,142.4 119.4,141.0 121.3,139.7 123.2,138.4 125.1,137.3 127.1,136.2 129.0,135.2 130.9,134.3 132.8,133.5 134.7,132.8 136.6,132.1 138.5,131.5 140.4,131.1 142.4,130.7 144.3,130.4 146.2,130.2 148.1,130.0 150.0,130.0 151.9,128.3 153.8,126.6 155.7,124.8 157.6,123.1 159.6,121.4 161.5,119.7 163.4,118.0 165.3,116.2 167.2,114.5 169.1,112.8 171.0,111.1 172.9,109.4 174.9,107.7 176.8,105.9 178.7,104.2 180.6,102.5 182.5,100.8 184.4,99.1 186.3,97.3 188.2,95.6 190.1,93.9 192.1,92.2 194.0,90.5 195.9,88.8 197.8,87.0 199.7,85.3 201.6,83.6 203.5,81.9 205.4,80.2 207.4,78.4 209.3,76.7 211.2,75.0 213.1,73.3 215.0,71.6 216.9,69.8 218.8,68.1 220.7,66.4 222.6,64.7 224.6,63.0 226.5,61.2 226.5,61.2 224.6,64.6 222.6,68.0 220.7,71.2 218.8,74.3 216.9,77.4 215.0,80.3 213