circle cx='226.5' cy='61.2' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='232.5' y='71.2'>(1,1)</text><circle cx='73.5' cy='198.8' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='23.5' y='194.8'>(−1,−1)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 130.0H294.0M150.0 254.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='73.5' y1='127.0' x2='73.5' y2='133.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='70.5' y='144.0' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='226.5' y1='127.0' x2='226.5' y2='133.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='223.5' y='144.0' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='147.0' y1='198.8' x2='153.0' y2='198.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='202.8' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='147.0' y1='61.2' x2='153.0' y2='61.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='65.2' font-size='10'>1</text></svg></div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(f\\) es impar y la bisectriz también, así que los dos recintos son simétricos respecto del origen y tienen la misma área. En \\((0,1)\\) la recta va por encima (\\(x\\geq x^2\\)):</p>\\[A=2\\int_0^1(x-x^2)\\,dx=2\\Bigl[\\frac{x^2}2-\\frac{x^3}3\\Bigr]_0^1=2\\cdot\\frac16=\\frac13\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac13\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"integ","tipo":"area","apartados":"a, b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2004-RESERVA-4.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2004-reserva-4-3","n":3,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Se sabe que el sistema de ecuaciones \\[\\begin{cases}x+\\alpha y=1\\\\x+\\alpha z=1\\\\y+z=\\alpha\\end{cases}\\] tiene una única solución.","apartados":["(1,25 p.) Prueba que \\(\\alpha\\neq0\\).","(1,25 p.) Halla la solución del sistema."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Tiene solución única si y solo si es compatible determinado: \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=3\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Rouché-Frobenius: el sistema es compatible si y solo si \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\); determinado si ese rango es el número de incógnitas, indeterminado si es menor.</i>, es decir, \\(|A|\\neq0\\). Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&\\alpha&0\\\\1&0&\\alpha\\\\0&1&1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(0+0+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(0+\\alpha+\\alpha\\bigr)\\]\\[=-2\\alpha\\]<div class='res'>Como tiene solución única, \\(|A|=-2\\alpha\\neq0\\), luego \\(\\alpha\\neq0\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Lo resuelvo por la regla de Cramer<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Cramer: si \\(|A|\\neq0\\), cada incógnita es el cociente entre el determinante que resulta de sustituir su columna por la de los términos independientes y el determinante \\(|A|\\) de la matriz de coeficientes.</i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&\\alpha&0\\\\1&0&\\alpha\\\\0&1&1\\end{vmatrix}=- 2 \\alpha\\]\\[x=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}1&\\alpha&0\\\\1&0&\\alpha\\\\\\alpha&1&1\\end{vmatrix}}{- 2 \\alpha}=\\frac{\\alpha (\\alpha^{2} - 2)}{- 2 \\alpha}=1 - \\frac{\\alpha^{2}}{2}\\]\\[y=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}1&1&0\\\\1&1&\\alpha\\\\0&\\alpha&1\\end{vmatrix}}{- 2 \\alpha}=\\frac{- \\alpha^{2}}{- 2 \\alpha}=\\frac{\\alpha}{2}\\]\\[z=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}1&\\alpha&1\\\\1&0&1\\\\0&1&\\alpha\\end{vmatrix}}{- 2 \\alpha}=\\frac{- \\alpha^{2}}{- 2 \\alpha}=\\frac{\\alpha}{2}\\]<div class='res'>Solución: \\((x,\\ y,\\ z)=(1 - \\frac{\\alpha^{2}}{2},\\ \\frac{\\alpha}{2},\\ \\frac{\\alpha}{2})\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"sistemas","tipo":"disc","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"sistemas","tipo":"res","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2004-RESERVA-4.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2004-reserva-4-4","n":4,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Calcula el área del triángulo de vértices \\(A(0,0,1)\\), \\(B(0,1,0)\\) y \\(C\\), siendo \\(C\\) la proyección ortogonal del punto \\((1,1,1)\\) sobre el plano \\(x+y+z=1\\).","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p><b>Proyección de </b>\\(P(1,1,1)\\)<b>:</b> la recta perpendicular al plano por \\(P\\) tiene director \\(\\vec n=(1,1,1)\\): \\((1+t,\\,1+t,\\,1+t)\\). Corte con el plano:</p>\\[3(1+t)=1\\iff t=-\\frac23\\ \\Rightarrow\\ C\\left(\\frac13,\\frac13,\\frac13\\right)\\]\\[\\overrightarrow{AB}=(0,1,-1),\\quad\\overrightarrow{AC}=\\left(\\tfrac13,\\tfrac13,-\\tfrac23\\right),\\quad\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AC}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\0&1&-1\\\\\\frac13&\\frac13&-\\frac23\\end{vmatrix}=\\left(-\\tfrac13,-\\tfrac13,-\\tfrac13\\right)\\]\\[\\text{Área}=\\frac12\\left|\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AC}\\right|=\\frac12\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt3}3=\\frac{\\sqrt3}6\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-6,\"el\":24,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-0.89,0.605,1.286],[0.605,-0.89,1.286],[1.39,-0.105,-0.286],[-0.105,1.39,-0.286]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[1.39,-0.105,-0.286],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"poly\",[[0,0,1],[0,1,0],[0.333,0.333,0.333]],\"#f59e0b\",\"#b45309\"],[\"line\",[1,1,1],[0.333,0.333,0.333],\"#e11d48\",1.6,false],[\"pt\",[0,0,1],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,1,0],\"B\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0.333,0.333,0.333],\"C\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[1,1,1],\"P\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m04r4a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m04r4a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m04r4a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m04r4a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='153.0,18.0 26.0,81.8 108.4,246.0 235.5,182.2' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='112.4' y='246.0' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><polygon points='104.5,79.8 199.4,162.9 139.5,149.4' fill='#f59e0b' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#b45309' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='209.4' y1='114.3' x2='139.5' y2='149.4' stroke='#e11d48' stroke-width='1.6'/><circle cx='104.5' cy='79.8' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='111.5' y='73.8' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='199.4' cy='162.9' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='206.4' y='156.9' font-weight='700'>B</text><circle cx='139.5' cy='149.4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='146.5' y='143.4' font-weight='700'>C</text><circle cx='209.4' cy='114.3' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='216.4' y='108.3' font-weight='700'>P</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='25.7' y2='276.5' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='23.3' y='282.7' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='39.9' y2='269.3' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='42.5' y='273.1' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='255.4' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='254.3' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(C\\left(\\frac13,\\frac13,\\frac13\\right)\\) y área \\(=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}6\\approx0{,}29\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"geom","tipo":"perp","apartados":""},{"tema":"geom","tipo":"area","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2004-RESERVA-4.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2004-reserva-4-5","n":5,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Halla una función \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) tal que su gráfica pase por el punto \\(M(0,1)\\), que la tangente en el punto \\(M\\) sea paralela a la recta \\(2x-y+3=0\\) y que \\(f''(x)=3x^2\\).","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[f'(x)=\\int3x^2\\,dx=x^3+C_1\\]<p>La recta \\(2x-y+3=0\\iff y=2x+3\\) tiene pendiente 2: \\(f'(0)=2\\iff C_1=2\\).</p>\\[f(x)=\\int(x^3+2)\\,dx=\\frac{x^4}4+2x+C_2,\\qquad f(0)=1\\iff C_2=1\\]<div class='res'>\\(f(x)=\\dfrac{x^4}4+2x+1\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"integ","tipo":"pcond","apartados":""},{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"tang","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2004-RESERVA-4.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2004-reserva-4-6","n":6,"num":2,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Considera la función \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) definida por \\(f(x)=e^x+4e^{-x}\\).","apartados":["(1 p.) Determina los intervalos de crecimiento y de decrecimiento de \\(f\\) y halla sus extremos absolutos o globales (puntos en los que se obtienen y valores que alcanza la función).","(1,5 p.) Calcula el área del recinto limitado por la gráfica de \\(f\\), el eje de abscisas y las rectas \\(x=0\\) y \\(x=2\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(f\\) es derivable en \\(\\mathbb R\\). Estudiamos el signo de \\(f'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>:</p>\\[f'(x)=e^x-4e^{-x}=\\frac{e^{2x}-4}{e^x}=0\\iff e^{2x}=4\\iff\\boxed{x=\\ln2}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 192 108' width='100%' style='max-width:230px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H178' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M96 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='96' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>ln 2</text><text x='29.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M43.0 10L79.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M70.0 39L79.0 40L77.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='55.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(0) &lt; 0</text><text x='111.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M125.0 40L161.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M152.0 11L161.0 10L159.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='137.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(1) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(f\\) decrece en \\((-\\infty,\\ln2)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\lt0\\), y crece en \\((\\ln2,+\\infty)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\gt0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>. Por eso en \\(x=\\ln2\\) alcanza su mínimo absoluto: \\(f(\\ln2)=2+\\frac42=4\\). Como \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}f(x)=+\\infty\\), no tiene máximo absoluto.</p><div class='res'>Decrece en \\((-\\infty,\\ln2)\\) y crece en \\((\\ln2,+\\infty)\\). Mínimo absoluto en \\((\\ln2,4)\\); no tiene máximo absoluto</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(f(x)\\gt0\\) siempre, así que el área es la integral:</p>\\[A=\\int_0^2(e^x+4e^{-x})\\,dx=\\Bigl[e^x-4e^{-x}\\Bigr]_0^2=(e^2-4e^{-2})-(1-4)=e^2-\\frac4{e^2}+3\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=e^2+3-\\dfrac4{e^2}\\approx9{,}85\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"mono","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"integ","tipo":"area","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2004-RESERVA-4.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2004-reserva-4-7","n":7,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sabiendo que \\(\\begin{vmatrix}x&y&z\\\\t&u&v\\\\a&b&c\\end{vmatrix}=-6\\), calcula, indicando las propiedades que utilices, los siguientes determinantes:","apartados":["(0,75 p.) \\(\\begin{vmatrix}-3x&-y&-z\\\\3t&u&v\\\\3a&b&c\\end{vmatrix}\\)","(0,75 p.) \\(\\begin{vmatrix}-2y&x&z\\\\-2u&t&v\\\\-2b&a&c\\end{vmatrix}\\)","(1 p.) \\(\\begin{vmatrix}x&y&z\\\\t&u&v\\\\2x-a&2y-b&2z-c\\end{vmatrix}\\)"]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Saco el 3 de la 1.ª columna y el \\(-1\\) de la 1.ª fila<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si se multiplica una fila (o columna) por un número, el determinante queda multiplicado por ese número.</i>:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}-3x&-y&-z\\\\3t&u&v\\\\3a&b&c\\end{vmatrix}=3\\begin{vmatrix}-x&-y&-z\\\\t&u&v\\\\a&b&c\\end{vmatrix}=3\\cdot(-1)\\begin{vmatrix}x&y&z\\\\t&u&v\\\\a&b&c\\end{vmatrix}=-3\\cdot(-6)=18\\]<div class='res'>\\(18\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Saco el \\(-2\\) de la 1.ª columna<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si se multiplica una fila (o columna) por un número, el determinante queda multiplicado por ese número.</i> e intercambio las dos primeras columnas<i class='n' data-t='th'>Al intercambiar dos filas o dos columnas, el determinante cambia de signo.</i>:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}-2y&x&z\\\\-2u&t&v\\\\-2b&a&c\\end{vmatrix}=-2\\begin{vmatrix}y&x&z\\\\u&t&v\\\\b&a&c\\end{vmatrix}=-2\\cdot\\left(-\\begin{vmatrix}x&y&z\\\\t&u&v\\\\a&b&c\\end{vmatrix}\\right)=2\\cdot(-6)=-12\\]<div class='res'>\\(-12\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado c","html":"<div class='ex'><p>La 3.ª fila es \\(2F_1-F_3\\). Separo en suma<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si una fila es suma de dos, el determinante es la suma de los determinantes con cada sumando en esa fila.</i>; el primero tiene dos filas proporcionales y vale 0<i class='n' data-t='th'>Un determinante con dos filas proporcionales vale 0.</i>:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}x&y&z\\\\t&u&v\\\\2x-a&2y-b&2z-c\\end{vmatrix}=\\begin{vmatrix}x&y&z\\\\t&u&v\\\\2x&2y&2z\\end{vmatrix}-\\begin{vmatrix}x&y&z\\\\t&u&v\\\\a&b&c\\end{vmatrix}=0-(-6)=6\\]<div class='res'>\\(6\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"det","apartados":"a, b, c"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2004-RESERVA-4.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2004-reserva-4-8","n":8,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Considera el punto \\(A(0,1,-1)\\), la recta \\(r\\equiv\\begin{cases}x-2y+z=0\\\\2x-z=-4\\end{cases}\\) y el plano \\(\\pi\\equiv x-2y-z=2\\). Halla la ecuación de la recta que pasa por \\(A\\), es paralela a \\(\\pi\\) y corta a \\(r\\).","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\): de la 2.ª, \\(z=2x+4\\); en la 1.ª, \\(x-2y+2x+4=0\\iff y=\\frac{3x+4}2\\). Con \\(x=2t\\): \\(r\\equiv(2t,\\,2+3t,\\,4+4t)\\).</p><p>La recta pedida está en el plano \\(\\pi'\\) paralelo a \\(\\pi\\) que pasa por \\(A\\): \\(x-2y-z+D=0\\), con \\(0-2+1+D=0\\iff D=1\\). Corta a \\(r\\) donde \\(r\\) corta a \\(\\pi'\\):</p>\\[2t-2(2+3t)-(4+4t)+1=0\\iff-8t-7=0\\iff t=-\\frac78\\ \\Rightarrow\\ Q\\left(-\\frac74,-\\frac58,\\frac12\\right)\\]\\[\\overrightarrow{AQ}=\\left(-\\frac74,-\\frac{13}8,\\frac32\\right)\\parallel(14,13,-12)\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":132,\"el\":12,\"p\":[[\"line\",[-3.2,-2.8,-2.4],[1.0,3.5,6.0],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.0,3.5,6.0],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[-2.8,-1.6,1.4],[3.5,4.25,-4.0],\"#e11d48\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[3.5,4.25,-4.0],\"s\",\"#e11d48\",6,0],[\"poly\",[[1.382,-0.317,3.016],[-1.426,-1.721,3.016],[-2.632,0.692,-3.016],[0.176,2.096,-3.016]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[-2.632,0.692,-3.016],\"π′\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"pt\",[0,1,-1],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-1.75,-0.625,0.5],\"Q\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m04r4b4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m04r4b4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m04r4b4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m04r4b4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><line x1='257.5' y1='204.9' x2='82.3' y2='18.0' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='88.3' y='18.0' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='231.2' y1='119.2' x2='26.0' y2='246.0' stroke='#e11d48' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='32.0' y='246.0' fill='#e11d48' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><polygon points='136.5,72.3 208.8,76.5 191.6,230.3 119.4,226.1' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='195.6' y='230.3' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π′</text><circle cx='140.0' cy='175.6' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='147.0' y='169.6' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='197.0' cy='140.4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='204.0' y='134.4' font-weight='700'>Q</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='12.1' y2='267.8' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='4.9' y='271.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='13.3' y2='272.5' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='6.5' y='277.3' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='254.3' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='252.9' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(\\begin{cases}x=14\\lambda\\\\y=1+13\\lambda\\\\z=-1-12\\lambda\\end{cases}\\), \\(\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>\\((14,13,-12)\\cdot(1,-2,-1)=14-26+12=0\\): es paralela a \\(\\pi\\) ✓.</i></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"geom","tipo":"ecs","apartados":""},{"tema":"geom","tipo":"pos","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2004-RESERVA-4.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"}]}